desc:TT-HOTT Multiband Up/Down Compressor
// @description TT-HOTT - OTT-style 3-band upward/downward compressor with a glass-box front: live transfer curves, per-band numbers and meters
// @author TimTechlor
// @version 0.9.12
// @link Manual https://timtechlor.de/docs/tt-hott-manual.html
// @license MIT
// @tags compressor multiband upward downward ott dynamics loud edm dubstep
// @provides
//   [nomain] img/tt-ui-options/hott-front.png
//   [nomain] img/tt-ui-options/hott-options.png
//   tt-hott-manual.html
//   img/tt-hott/tt-hott-macros.png
//   img/tt-hott/tt-hott-expert.png
//   img/tt-hott/tt-hott-bandoff.png
//   img/tt-hott/tt-hott-presets.png
//   img/tt-hott/tt-hott-start.png
//   img/tt-hott/tt-hott-start-shape.png
//   img/tt-hott/tt-hott-start-compare.png
// @about
//   # TT-HOTT
//   Over-the-top multiband dynamics: three bands, each with upward compression (quiet parts louder) and downward compression (loud parts tamed).
//   CLASSIC mode is a measured model of the well-known OTT setting (depth, time, up, down, per-band threshold and gain);
//   EXPERT mode shows and edits the real numbers behind it: thresholds, ratios, attack, release, make-up, crossover frequencies.
//   Zero latency at LOOKAHEAD 0 and CEILING 0 dB. Not affiliated with any product. The twin with five linear-phase bands is TT-HOTTER.
// @changelog
//   0.9.12 - First public release (Drop 07 of Acid Season), together with TT-HOTTER. Three minimum-phase Linkwitz-Riley bands, CLASSIC and EXPERT mode, START guided setup, true-peak CEILING, 30 factory presets including six techno presets.
// Historie: Spec auftraege/P29_TT-HOTT.md; Formeln MODEL.md; Entscheidungen im LOGBUCH.md.
// GENERIERT von build_hott.py aus ht_spec.py / presets.json - nicht von Hand aendern.

in_pin:In L
in_pin:In R
in_pin:Sidechain L
in_pin:Sidechain R
out_pin:Out L
out_pin:Out R

